2_331563614012225160_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RZgIE6iuQjQQ7kNvwGpFDW5&_nc_oc=AdqSOzACfKxACuxYHcRTJVVhZnHxfKQal-grolCuddRA4ycmZxeKdjX7tQ558q-HkpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ2G1p7it7dezlTUvmBhcRs5Ou0A3GfOJcF6Pq50XgBtg&oe=6AAE8D81"}, "display_name": "Augmental Puzzles", "keywords": ["logic", "puzzle", "sudoku", "picross", "minesweeper"], "long_description": "Hand-set **Sudoku, Nonograms and Minesweeper** on beautiful boards that float right in your room. No guessing, no pressure, no rush - just you, the puzzle, and that quiet click of a deduction falling into place. Every puzzle is set by hand and verified to be unique. \n\n# Built for your headset\nSolve seated at your real desk in passthrough, or switch it off and sink into a calm virtual space.  Big puzzles. Tiny table. Endless calm.\n\n# Sudoku \n{1395187132565062}\nSudoku runs from friendly 6x6 minis to giant 16x16 grids. \n# Nonograms\n{1893503988277025}\nPaint picture as you solve logic puzzles.\n \n# Minesweeper\n{27595814420096874}\nBuilt for pure deduction: every clue on the board from the start, no lucky clicks.\n\n# A fresh puzzle every day\n{2135770024013708}\n\n# Help that teaches\n{3270784359741014}\nA hint lights up the cells that matter and names the technique, so the next one is yours. Wrong placements show every clash. Infinite undo, replay and cloud saves: mistakes cost nothing, and your puzzle waits patiently.\n\n# Puzzle Packs\nFree to start: the Welcome Pack samples every mode and size, and the Daily Challenge lands every single day, gentle on Monday and a proper head-scratcher by Sunday. Post your time and climb the leaderboards.\n\nWant more? Optional hand-set packs run from gentle introductions to expert mega packs, plus Daily+ for the recent daily archive. Updates land regularly, and you can vote in-game for which classic we build next.", "short_description": "Unwind your mind with Augmental Puzzles, a soothing logic-puzzle lounge built for your headset. Solve hand-set Sudoku, Nonograms and Minesweeper on beautiful boards floating in your room. A fresh puzzle lands every single day, global leaderboards welcome the competitive, and regular updates keep the lounge growing. No guessing, no pressure, no rush."}]}, "developer_name": "Flammable Penguins Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/eula.html", "publisher_name": "Flammable Penguins Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28575582862079162"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1204032481605801_4874777616422444921_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KKSxBNz61uYQ7kNvwErK4Uw&_nc_oc=AdqRKqyT8kExrcXTRpTTUQepBf90qyxkW0-NvOVeMLgv1XhyB-q0JvdoVEAqaSL-6os&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJlQRRik5KCPmyV7W804s85Cx8GqR5sm9e6DyUvLm2O5w&oe=6AAE937D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Augmental Puzzles", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "conte